{
  "name": "Urban Lore",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You and your bonded familiar become Proficient in three skills out of the following: Deception, Insight, Investigation, Stealth, Persuasion, and Sleight of Hand. Both of you double your Proficiency for one of the chosen skills, this need not be the same skill. Both of you can use your spellcasting ability score in place of the usual ability score for any of the chosen skills.</p>",
